"rolled back, meaning that the changes are all discarded and the database is "
"unchanged.  See any database textbook for more information.)"
msgstr ""
"Pro lidi, ktere nejsou seznameni s terminologii databazi: sada zmen v "
"databazi je seskupena do transakce. Transakce mohou byt bud potvrzen nebo "
"vracenym. Viz jakakoliv ucebnice databazi pro vice informaci."

#: ../../whatsnew/2.5.rst:684
